  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,\r\n$7^{2 n}+16 n-1$\r\nPut $n=1,$ we get\r\n$\\begin{aligned} 7^{2}+16-1 & \\\\ =& 49+15 \\\\ =& 64 \\end{aligned}$\r\nwhich is divisible by 64."
  }
